WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:17,380
Can you please tell me the timing of when I can take alphalopeic acid for my

00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:23,420
neuropathy when I'm doing chemo? So alphalopeic acid is one of your stronger

00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:29,220
antioxidants that you cannot take during that 48 hours. So that's the whole

00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:34,620
thing. So if you're doing chemo infusions on Monday at 9 o'clock and you're

00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:41,380
done at 11 o'clock on Monday, do not take alphalopeic acid until 11 o'clock on

00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:47,100
Wednesday. So just those 48 hours post chemo is when you have to lay off an

00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:50,740
alphalopeic acid otherwise you could take it.

